'''Gigi''' was an [[astromech droid]] who operated during the [[High Republic Era]]. She served under the [[droid]] mechanic [[Rek Minuu]], where she was upgraded with a flying [[drone]] head.<ref name="DroidFriends" /> Sometime between [[232 BBY]] and [[230 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{YJADate|301A}}</ref> after [[Jedi Initiate]]s [[Kai Brightstar]], [[Nubs]], and [[Lys Solay]] revealed Minuu was stealing parts in order to upgrade droids, Gigi&mdash;along with fellow astromechs [[Dozer]] and [[Beepers]]&mdash;left Minuu; the droids opted to work for [[Dotti]] at their [[Dotti's Droid Workshop|workshop]] after the incident.<ref name="DroidFriends" />

